OL,3,ACelebrity hairstylist John Frieda dies
OL,4,Aaged 75
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish celebrity hairstylist and
OL,7,Fbeauty brand entrepreneur John Frieda
OL,8,Fhas died aged 75.
OL,10,FFrieda became a firm favourite with
OL,11,Fcelebrities throughout the 1960s and
OL,12,F1970s, and is known to have cut hair
OL,13,Ffor clients including Twiggy, Jackie
OL,14,FOnassis and Mick Jagger.
OL,16,FHe was also known for the range of hair
OL,17,Fproducts bearing his name, and the
OL,18,Ficonic Purdey bowl cut which he created
OL,19,Ffor actor Joanna Lumley in 1976.
OL,21,FHis death was announced by his hair
OL,22,Fsalon in an Instagram post on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
